sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant WebClient as Web Client
    participant UploadService as Upload Service
    participant FileStorage as File Storage (Blob)
    participant MetadataDB as Metadata DB (PostgreSQL)
    participant Redis as Redis (Cache)
    participant VirusScan as Virus Scanner

    User->>WebClient: Select files & click Upload
    WebClient->>UploadService: POST /api/v1/files/upload (files)
    UploadService->>VirusScan: Scan file(s) for malware
    VirusScan-->>UploadService: Scan result
    UploadService->>UploadService: Validate file type, size, structure
    UploadService->>FileStorage: Store file(s) (S3/Blob)
    UploadService->>MetadataDB: Save file metadata
    UploadService->>Redis: Track upload progress (optional)
    UploadService-->>WebClient: Return upload status, fileId(s)
    WebClient-->>User: Show upload result, progress, errors
    UploadService->>MetadataDB: Log upload event (audit)
    UploadService->>Redis: Add file to AI processing queue
    Note over UploadService,FileStorage: On error: respond with error, log event, clean up temp files